@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title POST /api/workspace/v1/messenger/streams/[stream_uuid]/actions/add_users/invoke
actor "客户端" as Client
participant "WorkspaceStreamBindingController\nRestAlchemy" as API
database "PostgreSQL\n规则行 + 绑定" as DB
queue "Transactional outbox\n+ 类型化任务的输出" as Outbox
participant "背景表演者\nexact scope leases + fencing" as Worker
database "已准备的投影\n连接容器" as Projection
database "公众活动存储器" as Events
participant "控制器 WebSocket" as Dispatcher
actor "客户端 WebSocket" as WS
Client -> API: POST /api/workspace/v1/messenger/streams/{stream_uuid}/actions/add_users/invoke
API -> DB: create/reactivate persistent USER_STREAM_BINDING\nactive=true; membership_generation++
API -> DB: immutable outbox event 每一个 typed task
DB --> API: 交易的固定
API --> Client: 成功的公开回复
DB ->> Outbox: 已记录的事件
Outbox ->> Worker: topic_membership_policy_rebuild / fanout /\nread_counters / folder_projection\n每一个 task 有自己的 outbox_event_uuid + expected generation
Worker -> Worker: topic scope: catch-up MESSAGE.created_at DESC;\nshared aggregates: user-stream/user-folder
Worker -> DB: conditional active + generation equality
Worker -> Projection: fresh binding + placement state;\n准备好了 shared projections
Worker -> Events: 流/绑定/文件事件\n原子在一个 DB transaction 投影
Events ->> Dispatcher: 已固定的准备行
Dispatcher ->> WS: 发送 / 重复 / 复制
note over API,Worker
  Grant active 立即使用; 历史上的显著性 eventual.
  旧的 binding/state 之前的 generation 没有恢复.
  Lease expiry/fencing, retry/backoff, DLQ/reaper 必须.
end note
@enduml
